ngholds of Khaz Modan."},["gate"]="HISTORICAL",["id"]="creature-trogg",["journalFields"]={"role"},["kind"]="creature",["period"]="classic",["related"]={"gnomeregan","dun-morogh"},["sourceIdentifiers"]={{["namespace"]="reference-url",["value"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Trogg"}},["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Trogg",["sourceVersion"]="world-facts-2026-10-26-r5",["title"]="Troggs"},{["aliases"]={"Naga","Nagas"},["category"]="creatures",["editorialStatus"]="ORIGINAL_AUTHOR_REVIEW; FIELD_SOURCE_QUALIFIED; NOT_EXHAUSTIVE",["fieldEvidence"]={["appearance"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="naga",["receiptSHA256"]="17dce2a9c6731a8d04ed092c6d60f4022d6619e35aeded2baad27f3976167efb"},["history"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="naga",["receiptSHA256"]="17dce2a9c6731a8d04ed092c6d60f4022d6619e35aeded2baad27f3976167efb"},["location"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="naga",["receiptSHA256"]="17dce2a9c6731a8d04ed092c6d60f4022d6619e35aeded2baad27f3976167efb"}},["fields"]={["appearance"]="Naga were scaled, serpentine beings able to live beneath the water.",["history"]="The naga descended from Azshara's Highborne, transformed when the Sundering dragged their ancient realm beneath the sea.",["location"]="Naga settlements reached the coasts of Azeroth, including the ruins along Azshara's shores."},["gate"]="HISTORICAL",["id"]="creature-naga",["journalFields"]={"appearance"},["kind"]="creature",["period"]="classic",["related"]={"ashenvale","darkshore"},["sourceIdentifiers"]={{["namespace"]="reference-url",["value"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Naga"}},["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Naga",["sourceVersion"]="world-facts-2026-10-26-r5",["title"]="Naga"},{["aliases"]={"Satyrs","Satyr"},["category"]="creatures",["editorialStatus"]="ORIGINAL_AUTHOR_REVIEW; FIELD_SOURCE_QUALIFIED; NOT_EXHAUSTIVE",["fieldEvidence"]={["history"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="satyr",["receiptSHA256"]="d