 coats among their familiar forms.",["relationships"]="A bear’s shape was one of the animal forms taken by druids; ordinary wild bears remained creatures in their own right."},["gate"]="HISTORICAL",["id"]="creature-bear",["journalFields"]={"appearance"},["kind"]="creature",["period"]="classic",["related"]={},["sourceIdentifiers"]={{["namespace"]="reference-url",["value"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Brown_bear"}},["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Brown_bear",["sourceVersion"]="world-facts-2026-10-26-r5",["title"]="Bears"},{["aliases"]={"Boars","Boar","Wild Boars","Wild Boar"},["category"]="creatures",["editorialStatus"]="ORIGINAL_AUTHOR_REVIEW; FIELD_SOURCE_QUALIFIED; NOT_EXHAUSTIVE",["fieldEvidence"]={["appearance"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="boar",["receiptSHA256"]="caab0a9b3de05c0d261f09fabc0b3180c76adcfa44d34b1a1d060d224551604b"},["context"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="boar",["receiptSHA256"]="caab0a9b3de05c0d261f09fabc0b3180c76adcfa44d34b1a1d060d224551604b"},["relationships"]={["method"]="PUBLIC_INDEXED_EXCERPT",["receiptID"]="boar",["receiptSHA256"]="caab0a9b3de05c0d261f09fabc0b3180c76adcfa44d34b1a1d060d224551604b"}},["fields"]={["appearance"]="Wild boars were hairy, cloven-hoofed beasts, the untamed kin of domestic pigs.",["context"]="Boars fed on both plant and animal matter rather than depending on a single kind of food.",["relationships"]="Quilboar revered boars, interpreting especially tenacious or imposing animals as signs of Agamaggan’s favor."},["gate"]="HISTORICAL",["id"]="creature-boar",["journalFields"]={"appearance"},["kind"]="creature",["period"]="classic",["related"]={},["sourceIdentifiers"]={{["namespace"]="reference-url",["value"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Boar"}},["sourceURL"]="https://warcraft.wiki.gg/wiki/Boar",["sourceVersion"]="world-facts-2026-10-26-r5",["title"]="Boars"},{["aliases"]={"Wolves","Wolf"},["category"]="creatures",["editorialStatus"]="ORIGINAL_AUTHOR_REVIEW; F